font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Información general&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;2&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Estado de cumplimiento y bases de presentación de los estados financieros consolidados&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;3&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Principales políticas contables&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;4&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Juicios y estimaciones contables relevantes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;5&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Adopción de normas internacionales de información financiera (NIIF) nuevas y revisadas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Notas de carácter específico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;6&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Posición moneda extranjera&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;7&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Propiedades, planta y equipo, neto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;8&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Arrendamientos y derechos de uso&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;9&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Activos intangibles, neto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;10&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Crédito mercantil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;11&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Inversiones financieras&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;12&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Deudores comerciales y otras cuentas por cobrar, neto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: 105%; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;13&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 105%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Efectivo y equivalentes de efectivo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&