; margin-left: 40.5pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="margin-left: 39.3pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;(1)&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;El incremento en fondos de inversión obedece a una mejora en la posición de caja, motivada por varios factores: el crédito intercompany que se tomó con Celsia y los recursos por capitalización recibidos de los accionistas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 18.0pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;(2)&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;El valor del efectivo y equivalente al efectivo restringido o no disponible para el uso corresponde a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="559" style="border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: 3.5pt; width: 419.0pt"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;td style="height: 12.0pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 268.0pt"/&gt;&lt;td style="height: 12.0pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 78.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;2019&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 12.0pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 73.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;2018&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;td style="height: 12.0pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 268.0pt"/&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="height: 12.0pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 78.0pt"/&gt;&lt;td style="height: 12.0pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 73.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;td style="height: 12.0pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 268.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;Fondos proyectos activos Celsia Tolima&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 12.0pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 78.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margi