ómico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; height: 5.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; width: 5.0cm"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Planes de mantenimiento y reposición de los activos de operación.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 5.65pt"&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; height: 5.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; width: 4.0cm"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormalCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 22.7pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;10.&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Ciberseguridad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 22.7pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; height: 5.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; width: 4.0cm"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Ataques cibernéticos que afecten la prestación de los servicios o la entrega de productos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;